Update: now resolved!

I've been shown where I was going wrong:

It is from the optim() function for general purpose optimisation. I needed to change the control default settings for reltol (relative tolerance) and maxit (maximum iterations), for example:

fm00 <- occu(~ obs_no ~ 1, umf00, control = list(reltol = 1e-20, maxit = 5000))

